{{feat
|type=class
|prereq=[[monk]] 12
|desc=The monk gains [[spell resistance]] equal to their [[class level]] + 10.
|use=automatic
|icon=ife_disoul.gif
|class1=monk
}}

== Notes ==
* The spell resistance granted by this feat cannot be lowered (e.g. by [[breach]]es).
*This feat means monks will not need to wear items with spell resistance, unless the item confers more spell resistance than this feat (as spell resistance does not [[stack]]).

== Builder notes ==
'''Item feat:''' No, but it can be added with custom content.

== Custom content notes ==
'''Removable:''' yes

'''Reusable:''' Yes, but any character without monk levels will only gain spell resistance 10.

'''Script:''' hardcoded

*This feat can be added to [[iprp_feats.2da]] to make it available as an item feat.